{"audio": "1john-04.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 157733, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2400, "text": "1 John, Chapter Four."}, {"start_ms": 2400, "end_ms": 11067, "text": "Beloved, believe not every spirit, but try the spirits whether they are of God: because many false prophets are gone out into the world."}, {"start_ms": 11067, "end_ms": 28000, "text": "Hereby know ye the Spirit of God: Every spirit that confesseth that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh is of God: And every spirit that confesseth not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh is not of God: and this is that spirit of antichrist, whereof ye have heard that it should come;"}, {"start_ms": 28000, "end_ms": 30933, "text": "and even now already is it in the world."}, {"start_ms": 30933, "end_ms": 38533, "text": "Ye are of God, little children, and have overcome them: because greater is he that is in you, than he that is in the world."}, {"start_ms": 38533, "end_ms": 43467, "text": "They are of the world: therefore speak they of the world, and the world heareth them."}, {"start_ms": 43467, "end_ms": 51067, "text": "We are of God: he that knoweth God heareth us; he that is not of God heareth not us."}, {"start_ms": 51067, "end_ms": 54667, "text": "Hereby know we the spirit of truth, and the spirit of error."}, {"start_ms": 54667, "end_ms": 63200, "text": "Beloved, let us love one another: for love is of God; and every one that loveth is born of God, and knoweth God."}, {"start_ms": 63200, "end_ms": 67733, "text": "He that loveth not knoweth not God; for God is love."}, {"start_ms": 67733, "end_ms": 76267, "text": "In this was manifested the love of God toward us, because that God sent his only begotten Son into the world, that we might live through him."}, {"start_ms": 76267, "end_ms": 83867, "text": "Herein is love, not that we loved God, but that he loved us, and sent his Son to be the propitiation for our sins."}, {"start_ms": 83867, "end_ms": 89067, "text": "Beloved, if God so loved us, we ought also to love one another."}, {"start_ms": 89067, "end_ms": 91467, "text": "No man hath seen God at any time."}, {"start_ms": 91467, "end_ms": 96400, "text": "If we love one another, God dwelleth in us, and his love is perfected in us."}, {"start_ms": 96400, "end_ms": 101600, "text": "Hereby know we that we dwell in him, and he in us, because he hath given us of his Spirit."}, {"start_ms": 101600, "end_ms": 106400, "text": "And we have seen and do testify that the Father sent the Son to be the Saviour of the world."}, {"start_ms": 106400, "end_ms": 112267, "text": "Whosoever shall confess that Jesus is the Son of God, God dwelleth in him, and he in God."}, {"start_ms": 112267, "end_ms": 116133, "text": "And we have known and believed the love that God hath to us."}, {"start_ms": 116133, "end_ms": 121333, "text": "God is love; and he that dwelleth in love dwelleth in God, and God in him."}, {"start_ms": 121333, "end_ms": 129333, "text": "Herein is our love made perfect, that we may have boldness in the day of judgment: because as he is, so are we in this world."}, {"start_ms": 129333, "end_ms": 135200, "text": "There is no fear in love; but perfect love casteth out fear: because fear hath torment."}, {"start_ms": 135200, "end_ms": 138000, "text": "He that feareth is not made perfect in love."}, {"start_ms": 138000, "end_ms": 141200, "text": "We love him, because he first loved us."}, {"start_ms": 141200, "end_ms": 152533, "text": "If a man say, I love God, and hateth his brother, he is a liar: for he that loveth not his brother whom he hath seen, how can he love God whom he hath not seen?"}, {"start_ms": 152533, "end_ms": 157733, "text": "And this commandment have we from him, That he who loveth God love his brother also."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 1069, "si": 0}, {"t": "John,", "s": 1069, "e": 1371, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1513, "e": 1876, "si": 0}, {"t": "Four.", "s": 1936, "e": 2198, "si": 0}, {"t": "Beloved,", "s": 2880, "e": 3301, 